{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日の２１時から\n46時間テレビがはじまり\n土曜日も終わりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間まであと少し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜１９時まで駆け抜けたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日の冒頭、タイムスケジュールを発表してるコーナーで\n46時間テレビは1年に一回くらいの\nペースでやりたいね！なんて\nみんなで話してたけど\n46時間テレビを完走できた達成感は\nものすごく気持ちいいもので。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっとメンバーが好きになって\nファンの方が好きになって\nスタッフさんの期待に応えていきたい！\nって思えるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、そう感じたんだけど\n今回はどう感じるんだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく！\n明日の終わりをみんなで\nエンディング迎えるときまで\n楽しんで頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/12/5842062/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/12/5842062/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/12/5842062/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、電視台のことや\n生誕祭のことは\n46時間テレビが終わってから\n書きます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと！ヒナセレも、まとまってきてます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間、スイカ食べれてないの。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカ食べたいよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/12/5842062/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、まともなブログ書いてない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。。。"}],"source":"archive"}